Salman Abedi, the man behind the Manchester bombing last month, also had Libyan connections. His family had sought asylum in Britain but later returned to Libya, where authorities say he belonged to a militant group backed by al-Qaida. Abedi's younger brother was being held for questioning in Libya.{g}
